1758:CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm4.h ****   \brief   Disable Interrupt
1759:CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm4.h ****   \details Disables a device specific interrupt in the NVIC interrupt controller.
